/-
ToeFormal/Derivation/QFTGRMinimalWorkingModelConservationRetestAttemptAfterPostRetestRefinementConservationRetestRefinementRefinementResultReview

Lean-side marker for the QFT-GR minimal working model v4 conservation-retest
attempt result review after the latest post-retest-refinement
conservation-retest refinement. The review consumes the executed bounded retest
attempt, accepts the recorded inconclusive classification, records the repeated
inconclusive pattern, does not convert it into a pass or failure, and
authorizes only one bounded obstruction-class stabilization packet target. It
does not authorize immediate retest or ordinary model refinement, rerun
conservation, claim conservation, construct a conservation proof object or
witness, claim source admissibility, claim Bianchi compatibility, derive the
semiclassical Einstein equation, close QFT-GR, validate empirically, authorize
public submission, or promote the master action.
-/

